    "title": "N7.4: optional isolated OCR utility host with bounded requests and cancellation",
    "objective": "Add native-hosts/ocr/ocr-host.cjs, the Electron utility host for the N7.1a-selected direct tesseract.js-core SIMD LSTM engine: network blocked before the engine loads, every asset verified against the pinned SHA-256, CPUs without WebAssembly SIMD refused, words and confidences only, no file writes, no logging. Its manager (app/main/ocr) enforces deadlines and aborts by killing the host, drops late results, bounds the queue, recycles on the resident-set ceiling, shuts down when idle, bounds restarts and stays off unless AWKIT_VISUAL_OCR=observe. Nothing is wired into runs (N7.5).",
